Bars, Beer Gardens, Nightlife","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Bars, Food, Nightlife","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"_C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"qg0jcxo-ZlV8G2sNj2C8ig","review_id":"Szgh4bmTd_tY9_o7WffaRQ","date":"2018-12-10T02:04:23","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9456018805503845,"text_excerpt":"Out in a warehouse district, we wanted to check out local beer scene when visiting NOLA from LA. This was a first stop and we wish didnt leave. The beer was great and consistent. The space was awesome. We were the only ones, showing up around 6:30 on a Sunday night, but they were very accommodating. After a bit a few groups came in. I didnt try the food but it looked great. There also seems to be regular trivia (Thursdays?) and other fun events. We had the cake stout, raspberry brown, kolsh and brut ipa. Everything was really delicious!"},{"business_id":"qg0jcxo-ZlV8G2sNj2C8ig","review_id":"dZJ3ao3gEDBkCguLSQTecw","date":"2017-07-17T03:49:16","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9419611096382141,"text_excerpt":"I'm very happy that I tried this place out. The beer is actually really great and so is the food. They serve small plates so you can try different bites as you taste different drafts. It does get loud when it's raining because of the tin roof, but that just adds to the charm. I look forward to adding this to my list of places for football games with friends, family, kiddos, and dogs! Favorite dish: goulachos Favorite draft(s): Session Ale & Tea Pale Ale"},{"business_id":"qg0jcxo-ZlV8G2sNj2C8ig","review_id":"l_UwuP88GPwzPop7fpcaDQ","date":"2019-10-01T13:01:16","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9385762214660645,"text_excerpt":"I am not a craft beer person, per say, but I really enjoyed this place! I had the Dorada, which had a Mexican beer taste. It was very flavorful. The space is beautiful and the food was incredible! We ordered the pork belly and watermelon lettuce wraps, the nachos with chicken, homemade pretzel with beer cheese and fries for the kiddos. I could and will order those nachos every time. They were amazing! The outdoor area is very kid and dog friendly, with lots of space to run, corn hole and 3 dart boards. Our bartender was friendly and extremely knowledgeable on all of the products Port Orleans has to offer."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"qg0jcxo-ZlV8G2sNj2C8ig","photo_id":"FTQbDk3V7axFL5us3XrZPQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/FTQbDk3V7axFL5us3XrZPQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8868491053581238},{"business_id":"qg0jcxo-ZlV8G2sNj2C8ig","photo_id":"CyZBSnrOPfv_-6vxBU-uTQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/CyZBSnrOPfv_-6vxBU-uTQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8781229853630066},{"business_id":"qg0jcxo-ZlV8G2sNj2C8ig","photo_id":"TxgCy4k1YI-81zmMlm7kiA","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/TxgCy4k1YI-81zmMlm7kiA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8700140714645386},{"business_id":"qg0jcxo-ZlV8G2sNj2C8ig","photo_id":"ecF7PYHAOcW-Oh3u_gl6mg","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/ecF7PYHAOcW-Oh3u_gl6mg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8412067294120789},{"business_id":"qg0jcxo-ZlV8G2sNj2C